    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## Auto-Instagram\nSelf-hosted n8n with **ffmpeg + ImageMagick** and this repo cloned on the host.\n\nHost env vars required: `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY`, `ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID`, `PEXELS_API_KEY`, `IG_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID`, `SCRIPTS_DIR` (path to repo `scripts/`), plus `CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME` + `CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET`.\n\nSee docs/SETUP.md."
      },
      "id": "setup",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -820,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 150,
        "content": "### On n8n Cloud?\nExecute Command / ffmpeg are not available there. Replace the two render nodes with an HTTP node calling a cloud render API (Creatomate / JSON2Video) that returns a public MP4 URL, then feed that into **Parse render output**. See docs/SETUP.md."
      },
      "id": "cloud-render-note",
      "name": "Cloud render note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        560
      ]
    }
  ],
